5.0.5.0

- Lucid Voice now updates its audio component cleanly across app versions, preserves working setups when an update fails, and keeps tone saving consistent.
- Failed Lucid Voice setup stays visible and retryable instead of falling back to a misleading ready state.
- Repair now separates device setup from live processing, includes recent Equalizer APO diagnostic evidence, and warns when Windows audio enhancements may prevent processing.
- Fixed an EQ filter that Equalizer APO could skip.
